      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image features Hulk Hogan, a well-known celebrity, in a pose that mimics a confrontational or authoritative stance, overlaid with text that reads 'well let me tell you something brother' and 'fuck niccfps'. The use of the word 'fuck' and the targeting of 'niccfps' (a likely reference to a specific group or individual) indicates an abusive tone. The meme uses the visual of a powerful, muscular figure to deliver a confrontational message, which can be interpreted as threatening or demeaning. The overall intent is to provoke, insult, or intimidate the target of the message, fitting the definition of an abusive meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
