      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Hulk_Hogan",
      "label": "Hulk Hogan",
      "description": "Hulk Hogan is a former professional wrestler and actor, widely known for his larger-than-life persona and catchphrases. His image is often used in memes to convey authority, intimidation, or a confrontational tone. The text 'well let me tell you something brother' is a direct reference to his famous catchphrase, which he used to deliver dramatic monologues in his wrestling persona. This background knowledge is essential to understand the tone and intent of the meme.",
